From 2a04a1fc05c144bf6fde23ceca30f4d8f76095f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michal Frdlik <michaelf.ms@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 20:06:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 10/22] Thylacine Warp V-3b-3a: the Venus vn_renderer backend +
 loader-less ICD proof

The Mesa Venus driver runs on Thylacine via a vn_renderer backend that speaks
9P over /srv/warp (Model B: virglrenderer polls the host3d command ring
tapestryd mints/maps), not virtgpu/DRM. Vtest-shaped: userspace transport, no
kernel DRM device.

Build-system integration:
- meson.build (top): system_has_kms_drm=false for thylacine -> dep_libdrm is
  null_dep (Thylacine has no DRM; the virgl winsys uses the warp transport).
- src/virtio/vulkan/meson.build: with_thylacine gate -- the backend in;
  virtgpu + libdrm + vtest + WSI out; a STATIC loader-less ICD (Thylacine has
  no dynamic loader, so no shared_library and no ICD json) + a
  thylacine-venus-prove executable.
- include/renderdoc_app.h: __thylacine__ added to the __linux__ platform arm.

Backend (vn_renderer_thylacine.c): the 20-pointer vn_renderer vtable; ops
stubbed for the transport bring-up (V-3b-3b/3c); info-init minimal (capset
deferred to V-3c). vn_renderer.h routes vn_renderer_create to it under
__thylacine__.

Proof (thylacine_prove.c, the virgl_prove.c analog): a static ET_EXEC links the
venus archive + resolves vk_icdGetInstanceProcAddr by symbol (loader-less) +
dispatches vkEnumerateInstanceVersion. Witnessed on Thylacine:
"THYLACINE-VENUS-PROVE PASS ... vkEnumerateInstanceVersion -> 1.4.354".
---
